  "description": "Operating Area: Thailand\n\nShe is the biggest yacht in our fleet, able to carry up to 60 guests on day charters & 14 on overnight charters. Her spaciousness and ample room make her the ideal boat for large group charters. Experience 5* service from our professional crew and have a blast with our water activities that you can't get bored of! Shangani can only go to the following islands on day trips kai island - Maiton Phang Nga Bay - Naka Island both Kai Islands to visit Phi Phi Islands on her the charter must be an overnight as the journey to Phi Phi takes 4 hours.\n",
